---
source: crates/wt-agent-git/src/gateway.rs
expression: HELP
---
ag-git reads and changes explicitly identified Git provider resources.

USAGE:
ag-git COMMAND RESOURCE [ID] [OPTIONS]

COMMANDS:
show mr|run|job ID
list threads mr ID
list ci commit SHA
list jobs run ID
log job ID
wait mr|run|job ID
open mr --head BRANCH --base BRANCH [--draft]
set mr ID ready|draft|open|closed
edit mr ID [--title TEXT] [--body TEXT]
comment mr ID TEXT
reply thread ID --mr MR_ID TEXT
set thread ID --mr MR_ID resolved|open
retry job ID
cancel job|run ID
help                              Show this help

The provider and project come from this world's gateway grant. Every other
resource is explicit. Use normal Git for commits, fetches, pulls, and pushes.
